sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Orchestrator (code)
    participant T as Tester (code half)
    participant SB as Sandbox MCP (Docker, no network)
    participant D as Debugger
    participant M as Memory MCP (ChromaDB)
    participant P as Planner

    loop attempt = 1 .. 3 (max_retries_per_stage)
        O->>T: execute(code, tests) on the SAMPLE
        T->>SB: run_stage(code, inputs=sample, schema, tests)
        SB-->>T: ExecutionResult (ok / error / failed tests / quarantined rows)
        opt sample passed
            T->>SB: run_stage(code, inputs=full data)
            SB-->>T: ExecutionResult
        end
        alt passed on sample and full data
            O->>O: stage passed, leave loop
        else only the tests themselves crashed
            O->>T: write_tests(broken=...) once, the Debugger never edits tests
        else failed and attempts remain
            O->>D: spec, code, exact error, failed tests, what was already tried
            D->>M: search_fixes(error) [optional tool call]
            M-->>D: verified fixes of similar errors
            D-->>O: DebugPatch (diagnosis + whole new code)
        end
    end
    alt stage passed after a debugger fix
        O->>M: remember_fix(first error, diagnosis) - only verified fixes are stored
    else stage still failing and a replan is left
        O->>P: replan(previous plan, failed stage, error, passed stages)
        P-->>O: revised plan, unchanged passed stages are kept
    else no replans left
        O->>O: status failed, write report, stop cleanly
    end
